# Parcel Canopy's root cellar under the canopy roots (CIPlay parcel_canopy_caves, 11-12 w12 prep; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe (the origin frame): the root knoll hw_mount at 54 4 (b 18, h 24, foot 5.28 m); kit_dig mouth at 35 4
# (way in = +x), 2 m level, the tunnel to 51 4, the chamber to 57 4; Raft's machete vines (pcroots_vines) across the mouth. Floor
# ~5.28 (a guess). Offline-written, never run; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (the knoll may move the
# land centre).
island Parcel Canopy keep
offset 0 26
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the mouth shut by the vines
picture pc_roots_out 20 +3 4 35 +1.5 4
walk 30 4 to 33 4 to 36 4 blocked
expect shown pcroots_vines
use pcroots_vines
expect hidden pcroots_vines
picture pc_roots_cut 22 +2.5 4 35 +1.5 4

# In along the tunnel to the chamber
# the two rats in the root cellar (11-12 mixed monsters): alive on the dug floor, under the knoll's rock
expect animals Rat 2
expect animalsinside Rat 2
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0

walk 31 4 to 35 4 to 42 4 to 51 4 to 55 4
zone pc_roots
picture pc_roots_in 43 +2.5 4 55 +0.5 4 light=20

# Out again
walk 55 4 to 51 4 to 42 4 to 35 4 to 30 4
